# M2's text input, into a's number box (330, 408.5, 107, 32 at 1440 x 900), the page's own field
# since M7: a click opens it with "1.00" selected, as React's opens, and text input starts; "1.25"
# typed takes the selection's place, in --foreground with the caret after it; Esc puts 1.00 back
# and closes the field, and the box keeps the focus with its ring and the keys' tip, as WebKit and
# Chromium show them. The page waits 2 s first, as M6's states do, so React's plane has finished
# its first paint.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 383 424
wait 16
shot open
type "1.25"
wait 16
shot typed
key Escape
wait 16
shot closed
